1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Send a Gmail thread to your AI.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,000
Free, open source, runs on your computer.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,800
Tick the AIs you use.

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:12,000
Changes save straight away.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,967
Right-click an email. Pick an AI.

6
00:00:14,967 --> 00:00:22,900
It opens the email and copies the thread.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,800
Paste and read it.

8
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:34,367
Nothing is sent until you press Enter.

9
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:38,200
Or tick several emails at once.

10
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,300
It reads each email without opening it.

11
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:45,000
It asks the AI to sort them into tasks.

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,500
Or copy it for any AI.

13
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:52,900
Claude Code and Codex read it themselves.

14
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:56,500
The email's text is never in the link.

15
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:01,000
It is told to do the work, then ask first.

16
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,867
Nothing ticked? Triage your unread emails.

17
00:01:04,867 --> 00:01:08,200
It copies them, and they stay unread.

18
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:12,500
The AI sorts them: Action, Consolidate,
Disregard and Draft.

19
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:16,733
Or tick some, then click the icon
in the browser's toolbar.

20
00:01:16,733 --> 00:01:21,000
It lists your AIs for what you ticked.

21
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
In Settings, write
your own instructions.

22
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,000
No server, no account, no tracking.

23
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,500
Free and open source.
